| every wallet that qualified on the first part (test window) | 3580 | 1774 | $35,075 | -2,058.60 | -5.9% | -2.85 |
| currently copied (test window) | 3218 | 1627 | $31,474 | -401.26 | -1.3% | -0.39 |

